# Stable spec ID: iba-clover-club. Source checked 2026-10-13. Machine generated; not human reviewed or taste-tested.

::ingredients
(gin) 45 ml
(raspberry syrup) 15 ml
(lemon: juice, fresh) 15 ml
(egg: white) a few drops

::equipment
(cocktail shaker)
(cocktail glass)

::instructions
<shake, measured ingredients with ice in (cocktail shaker)>
<strain, into a chilled (cocktail glass)>
<garnish, with fresh raspberries>

